{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/28c4f89e435547d991e645d6ff449836"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/3eaf8497383d435c94bc570ee0c72cf7"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/044b5886640e443fbb201ca07d7849ea"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/28c4f89e435547d991e645d6ff449836","stringItemText":"Geotechnical Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/3eaf8497383d435c94bc570ee0c72cf7","stringItemText":"Concrete Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/044b5886640e443fbb201ca07d7849ea","stringItemText":"Soil Testing"}],"settingsData":[]}
